Open separate CMD and navigate to the Project Folder and to "app"  like D:\GitHub\FastApiArgoProject\app:
run from app folder:

cd /d D:\GitHub\FastApiArgoProject\app
.venv\Scripts\activate.bat
python -m uvicorn api.main:app --reload

And server start to listen:
Open Browser and check: http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

